<section class="our-values">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How it Works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Measure first</strong>
        Nothing gets built before the baseline exists. If it moves, measure it.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Incremental Gains</strong>
        Iterate, Make small, reversible changes with tracking already in place.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Document everything</strong>
        If you do it once, you&rsquo;ll do it again. Documenting the process means you can hand it off to someone else later.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Reporting</strong>
        What shipped and what it moved.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

